{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa795c4a7028114331c3d2","chatId":"8e6243f716a0450b8d5dab5ac49fd4ef","sessionId":null,"userId":100411,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1514,"promptTokens":1615,"completionTokens":64,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:32:44"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"2b8f5decbbde41ed9417e082cc5eaeb0","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0052201245328602945,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6afa795c4a7028114331c3d1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794799964386,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:32:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa795c4a7028114331c3d1","chatId":"8e6243f716a0450b8d5dab5ac49fd4ef","sessionId":null,"userId":100411,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n松风、建元和雪枫是同一个小组的成员，他们需要共同完成一个学校项目。现在，项目的核心任务下来了，大家都想把这个重要任务承担下来，但都不想让自己过于辛劳。松风看向建元，然后看向正在自顾自玩手机的雪枫，然后对建元笑了笑，他似乎有了主意。接着他走到教室的角落，去取他的书包，然后故作无意地将一个小纸条留在了建元的课桌上。他回来后，给建元一个眼色，然后继续埋头做他的事情。建元看到这个纸条，迅速展开，看了一眼，然后他也笑了。他看向松风说：“我刚刚有了个主意，咱们俩一起做这个任务，你觉得怎么样？”\n\n[问题]\n雪枫听见建元的主意后会有什么感觉？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 雪枫觉得很轻松，因为这意味着她可以少做一些工作。\nB. 雪枫感觉有些奇怪，不明白自己为什么突然被排除在核心人员之外。\nC. 雪枫可能害怕，因为她可能担心和建元的合作效果。\nD. 雪枫感到高兴，因为她责任繁重，期待有人和她共同承担任务。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"2b8f5decbbde41ed9417e082cc5eaeb0","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0052201245328602945,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6afa795c4a7028114331c3d2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794799964382,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:32:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ee7c62e6d85c42aba00be3d2e7bdca31"}